        <mxCell id="foot" value="&lt;b&gt;What the trace tells you:&lt;/b&gt; LLM calls take about 94% of the time, tools almost none. Input tokens grow each step (the history is re-sent). To make it faster: fewer steps, a faster model, or call both tools in parallel." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#e3e0d8;dashed=1;fontColor=#1f2328;fontSize=13;align=left;spacingLeft=12;arcSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
